  "content": "<p>地牢扩展为我的世界新增了6个动画自定义生物</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━<br>生物<br>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>&nbsp;狱卒&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_188ebc49-6e13-4972-8712-0583ece7d309.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"200\"></p><p>灾厄守卫&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_e7f3b1b2-273b-49dd-935b-8ca89730d7a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"159\"></p><p>精英唤魔者<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_a083acc1-8676-4f06-9376-d1f5f368d8a2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"207\"></p><p>部落战士&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_902a2da4-4fbc-4d21-9337-87cd38de27f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>部落酋长&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_8cc2939a-3605-4d85-8c94-d7c2d0e490ea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"114\" height=\"160\"></p><p>流浪商人</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1595646/description_0ac3a30b-7ce9-43bf-83ad-f715e18f32da.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━<br>袭击整合<br>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>狱卒：第4-7波<br>灾厄守卫：第8波<br>精英唤魔者：第8波<br>可通过配置文件（dungeonsadditions-common.toml）为每个实体单独配置。</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━<br>物品<br>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>部落矛——铁质武器（2点基础伤害，-1.8攻击速度）<br>所有7种生物对应的刷怪蛋</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p><strong>鸣谢</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>这是Infamous团队已停更项目的非官方移植版。</p><p>alexanderfunandgames：原版模组主要拥有者</p><p>e_i_am_a_pikachu：对精英唤魔者及其他内容进行了改进</p><p>carlo_andre01：大多数生物的创造者</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
